    "html": "<p>Sample P of a radioactive isotope has initial activity <em>A</em> and half-life <em>T</em>. Sample Q of a different radioactive isotope has initial activity 3<em>A</em> and half-life <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{2}\"></span>. The initial number of particles in sample P is <em>N</em>.</p>\n<p>What is the initial number of particles in sample Q?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{N}{6}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2N}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3N}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">6<em>N</em></li>\n</ol>"
